{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草で見かけたよーってコメント多くてビックリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づくものなのねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、永島のせいらりんがDVDを見にまあや家に来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし今日も遊びに来てくれます(この記事書いたの結構前です)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜来るらしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前せいらりんに\n『まあや見ると心がやすらぐ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダブルマイマイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと田舎と都会の違いの会話をしてた時..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山かずみん\n『そういえば東京はマック、ドライブスルーないよねぇ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石！和田\n『あぁ確かに〜』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと田舎と都会の違いを学習しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後〜！個別握手会で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『犬みたい』\n白石\n『猫って言ってくれ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと鋭い突っ込みされました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんでその後\n和田\n『猫みたい♪』\nっていったら\n『犬だよっ♪』\nって言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん面白い〜♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お礼が遅くなってごめんなさい\n皆様のおかげで今回もオリコンウィークリーチャート1位になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像の中から、まあやを見つけたよ〜とか13日の金曜日良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よ〜とかいってもらえて嬉しい気持ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服も私服だったから、良かったよ〜って言ってもらえて良かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、東日本大震災では皆それぞれの気持ちを伝えてくれて...本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝え続けていかないといけない出来事だと私も思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日１人１人が色んな経験や思いをしたんだと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度20日の全国握手会のペアーは、秋元まなつちゃんだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんの取り扱い説明書"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんはドキドキする\n(特に個人PV はキュンキュンだったよー)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやへの口癖は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『よく食べるねっ★』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくるよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(他のことも言ってよ〜笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんが言うこと聞いてくれない時は、甘いものを持って、近づけばOK"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんは料理上手ですっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまなったんファムの皆様、宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16日に東京スポーツ新聞にまあやが出てたんだけど告知してなかったから、コメントで「教えてよ〜」って書いてくれてて嬉しかったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はまあやも、いつ出るんだっけ〜!?って思ってたの..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日は急いで買いに行ったよ♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはバットマンの絵が好きで、洋服や、バックを持ってるんだけど、皆は好きな漫画の絵ってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日はみくもちゃんがとまりにくるのでまたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ちなみに昨日は、あみちゃんがとまって、夜にせいらりんとなーちゃんが遊びにきたよー)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/19/0079917/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}